Z||000000||87 Steve GT||02-03-2000||08:05 PM||||Well, Lately I have been bit by the V-8 Fiero Idea in my head... you ALL know that when we  start thinking about a new idea for our sportcar... that all i can think about... This car sometimes makes me crazy...   MOST of the time these day's... Hearing all you different people that have 3.1 or bigger motor's... turbo's... ETC... So, I'm not trying to blabber... But YOU UNDERSTAND????  so to the point of the 3.8 SFI V-6.... That's is what is in the 2000 Camero... some anyway's.... Does anyone know HOW MANY HORSEPOWER THEY HAVE... see it's making me YELL... sorry guy's and gal's.... Has anyone put one in a Fiero yet?? could we??? should we???  WORTH IT???   thank's for being here...  Not EVEN my Mom understand's... LOL||||reg||1
